;; fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba), parsing/parser.mly: its header's helpers and the
;; semantic action of each of its productions (and of the rules of Menhir's standard library it uses), whose notice
;; follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
